            "review_text": "Kieugiang C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nlocal snail food\nFeb 2020\nthere are many wide range of snails such as horned nerite snail, sweet snail, gun snail, coconut snail, starfruit snail, apple snail, mud creeper which are cooked in different ways. Don't miss eating at local snail food. It’s not easy for tourists to find out this place to eat safe and delicious snail in a city.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 4, 2020",
